ential threats. Therefore, this system integrates surveillance technology, ranging from intelligent data analysis to cryptography, which is more secure against human interference. It is imperative in governance, businesses, and other sectors of the economy. These sectors require secure monitoring and transparency, making the era of AI and quantum computing a crucial time for data management systems. Β© 2025 IEEE.},
